D_IMPL_2="Phase 1 implementation task. Serves: AC-2. Round through Decimal(str(km)) with ROUND_HALF_UP; an int stays whole and a float keeps its one decimal (tasks.md Change 2). Inner tests in tests/test_view_model.py: patch rides.view_model.Decimal and assert it is constructed with str(km) ('1.15' for 1.15), not the float; assert quantize is called once with Decimal('0.1') and rounding=ROUND_HALF_UP; assert the isinstance(km, int) branch returns before Decimal is called for 5; assert normalize is never called. Existing expectation: tests/test_view_model.py:9 expects format_distance(12.25) == '12.2 km'; under AC-2 it becomes '12.3 km'. Done when python3 -m pytest -q passes."
